      ("help", "Print help (see a summary with '-h')")] }),
  (["component", "wit"], {
    about := some "Tool for working with the WIT text format for components.\n\nThis subcommand can be used to inspect and debug the WIT text or binary format with either WIT packages or binary components. Using this subcommand a WIT package can be translated to binary, a WIT binary can be translated back to text, and a WIT document can be extracted from a component binary to inspect its interfaces.",
