      ("verbose", "Use verbose output (-v info, -vv debug, -vvv trace)"),
      ("color", "Configuration over whether terminal colors are used in output.\n\nSupports one of `auto|never|always|always-ansi`. The default is to detect what to do based on the terminal environment, for example by using `isatty`."),
